      "comment": "BART INTENTION (4) is a sprinter who thrives over these shorter races. Finished fourth latest over 390m at Warrnambool (22.47) in a Grade 5. Has a strong winning record at this journey including three wins. Has ability and looks hard to stop. PAW INFLAME (3) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (24.11) behind I'm Easy at Bendigo. Expected to feature. BRAGGING RIGHTS (8) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Paw Yaz (22.49) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Leading player again. ",
